      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update: further testing has revealed the actual issues. First, its not just avatar chairs that pass Is Valid but also the player's handheld camera (and probably some other things I didn't bother to test). Is Valid itself seems to be bugged when testing protected objects.\nSecond, protected objects CAN be tested Null successfully using Equality or Inequality, but NOT Equals. This isn't necessarily problematic by itself, except that when using Noodle Search with Collider Other it won't show Equality or Inequality, only Equals. This is what lead me to believe that avatar chairs passed null checks.\nIn conclusion, this was a perfect storm of stupidity that culminated in me losing 3-4 hours of my life.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
